.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_HASH 3 2026-08-14 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_hash \- calculate the Storm hashes for an MPQ filename.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B
#include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "void libmpq__file_hash("
.BI "        const char     *" "filename",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "hash1",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "hash2",
.BI "        uint32_t       *" "hash3"
.BI ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Call \fBlibmpq__file_hash\fP() to calculate the three Storm filename hashes
used by the MPQ hash table. The values can be reused with
\fBlibmpq__file_number_from_hash\fP() when looking up the same filename in
multiple archives.
.LP
The function stores the three hash values in \fIhash1\fP, \fIhash2\fP,
and \fIhash3\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__file_number (3),
.BR libmpq__file_number_from_hash (3)
